#: src/main.ui:60
msgid "Face models"
msgstr "Modeli obraza"

#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Posnetki vašega obraza, s katerimi se Ubuntu Hello primerja. Hranite vsaj "
"dva, posneta pri različni svetlobi."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Prikaz shranjenih modelov za:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Registriran je samo en model obraza. Očala, sprememba brade ali drugačna "
"osvetlitev spremenijo, kako kamera vidi vaš obraz, zato lahko en sam model "
"odpove (na primer zvečer pod svetilkami). Dodajte drugi model z očali ali "
"brez njih, z vašim drugim videzom ali pri drugi svetlobi, da odklepanje "
"ostane zanesljivo."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Dodajte drugi model"

