#: src/main.ui:445
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Prikaže se obvestilo na namizju, medtem ko Ubuntu Hello išče vaš obraz in "
"nato sporoči rezultat. Neuspeli poskusi ostanejo na seznamu obvestil."

#: src/main.ui:476
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Prikaži obvestila"

#: src/main.ui:482
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Ena kartica na poskus preverjanja pristnosti z obrazom, posodobljena na "
"mestu z rezultatom."

#: src/main.ui:513
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Zvoki obvestil"

#: src/main.ui:519
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Predvajaj sistemski zvok za prepoznan ali neuspešen poskus."

#: src/main.ui:550
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Vključi diagnostiko"

#: src/main.ui:556
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Vsaki kartici dodajte model, gotovost v primerjavi s pragom, okvirje, kamero "
"in čas. Uporabno pri poročanju o težavi."

#: src/main.ui:618 src/main.ui:734
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Varnost"

#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Kako natančno se mora vaš obraz ujemati in ali vas Ubuntu Hello pozove, da "
"potrdite, da ste res prisotni."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Strogost ujemanja obraza"

#: src/main.ui:665 src/onboarding.ui:151
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "hitro"

#: src/main.ui:672 src/onboarding.ui:182
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Uravnotežen"

#: src/main.ui:680 src/onboarding.ui:213
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Varno"

#: src/main.ui:702 src/onboarding.ui:250
msgid "Ask me to nod to confirm"
msgstr "Za potrditev zahtevaj prikimavanje"

#: src/main.ui:708 src/onboarding.ui:259
msgid ""
"After your face matches, a notification asks you to nod. A photo held up to "
"the camera cannot nod."
msgstr ""
"Ko se vaš obraz ujema, vas obvestilo pozove, da prikimate. Fotografija, ki "
"jo pokažete kameri, ne more prikimati."

#: src/main.ui:771 src/onboarding.ui:759
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Obesek za ključe / KWallet Samodejno odklepanje"

#: src/main.ui:786
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Omogočite preverjanje pristnosti z obrazom, da samodejno odklenete obesek "
"ključev za prijavo ali KWallet ob prijavi. To varno shrani vaše geslo, "
"zapečateno v TPM, ko je na voljo, ali šifrirano z AES-256-GCM z glavnim "
"ključem samo za root. Preverjanje obraza nastavi PAM_AUTHTOK za "
"pam_gnome_keyring ali pam_kwallet5, odvisno od vašega namizja."

#: src/main.ui:814
msgid "Current Status:"
msgstr "Trenutno stanje:"

#: src/main.ui:823
msgid "Checking..."
msgstr "Preverjanje ..."

#: src/main.ui:834
